<font></font>
   Responses to the CONNECT method are not cacheable.<font></font>
<font></font>
<span class="h4" id="autoid-40"><a class="selflink" id="section-4.3.7" href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7231#section-4.3.7">4.3.7</a>.  OPTIONS</span><font></font>
<font></font>
   The OPTIONS method requests information about the communication<font></font>
   options available for the target resource, at either the origin<font></font>
   server or an intervening intermediary.  This method allows a client<font></font>
   to determine the options and/or requirements associated with a<font></font>
   resource, or the capabilities of a server, without implying a<font></font>
   resource action.<font></font>
