<span class="grey"><a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7231">RFC 7231</a>             HTTP/1.1 Semantics and Content            June 2014</span><font></font>
<font></font>
<font></font>
   An OPTIONS request with an asterisk ("*") as the request-target<font></font>
   (<a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7230#section-5.3">Section&nbsp;5.3 of [RFC7230]</a>) applies to the server in general rather<font></font>
