<font></font>
      Note: The Expect header field was added after the original<font></font>
      publication of HTTP/1.1 [<a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2068" data-bs-original-title="&quot;Hypertext Transfer Protocol -- HTTP/1.1&quot;">RFC2068</a>] as both the means to request an<font></font>
