   | POST    | no   | no         | <a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7231#section-4.3.3">Section 4.3.3</a> |
   | PUT     | no   | yes        | <a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7231#section-4.3.4">Section 4.3.4</a> |
   | TRACE   | yes  | yes        | <a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7231#section-4.3.8">Section 4.3.8</a> |
